OL,3,GNEWSAMum 'would still be here' with
OL,4,Abetter Covid rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man whose mother died at a care home
OL,7,Fduring the Covid-19 pandemic has said
OL,8,Fshe would still be here if better
OL,9,Fmeasures had been in place.
OL,11,FCathleen Sexton died in Melbury Court
OL,12,Fcare home in Durham at the age of 85
OL,13,Fafter contracting the disease in 2020.
OL,14,FSome patients went from the nearby
OL,15,FUniversity Hospital of North Durham to
OL,16,Fthe home without being tested for Covid
OL,17,For after a positive test.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
