OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMum 'would still be here' with
OL,4,Abetter Covid rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FSon Paul Sexton, from
OL,7,FChester-le-Street, said Cathleen was
OL,8,Fstrong and would still be here if
OL,9,Fguidance to isolate arrivals had been
OL,10,Fin place earlier.
OL,12,FIt comes as a highly critical sixth
OL,13,Freport of the Covid inquiry said there
OL,14,Fwas no "protective ring" around care
OL,15,Fhomes and action to protect them came
OL,16,Ftoo late.
